WEBVTT

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:13.210
ALL: Whoa!

00:00:27.266 --> 00:00:28.851
(YELLS)

00:00:39.362 --> 00:00:41.447
(ALL SINGING CHORUS)

00:00:47.536 --> 00:00:48.704
Aren't they great?
他们表演得真好

00:00:48.788 --> 00:00:51.457
What, are you kidding me?
It's like watching Jell-O dancing around.
开什么玩笑？这像是看两坨布丁跳舞

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:54.126
(SCOFFS) Like you
could do any better, pip-squeak.
你也不见得能如此演出 小不点

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:55.544
(ALL LAUGH)

00:00:55.628 --> 00:00:56.962
All right, all right. Hey!
好的！

00:00:57.046 --> 00:01:00.466
You wanna see something great?
I'll show you great.
你们要见识真正好的表演？看我的

00:01:00.633 --> 00:01:02.301
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:01:04.178 --> 00:01:05.596
(SINGING)

00:01:07.181 --> 00:01:08.474
(SINGING)

00:01:10.142 --> 00:01:12.561
(BOTH SINGING)

00:01:26.492 --> 00:01:27.576
(CHEERING)

00:01:32.123 --> 00:01:34.250
Gunter and Rosita!
甘特和罗西塔！

00:01:35.626 --> 00:01:37.336
Kids! No! Back to your seats!
孩子们 不！快回到座位上！

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:39.588
Okay, okay. Whoa!
好的

00:01:39.839 --> 00:01:41.549
Norman!
诺门！

00:01:48.764 --> 00:01:49.932
All right!
好的！

00:01:50.015 --> 00:01:51.934
Piggy power! Ha-ha!
猪猪魅力！

00:01:56.564 --> 00:01:57.648
That was great!
好极了！

00:01:57.732 --> 00:01:58.733
-(YELPS)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
好极了！

00:01:59.108 --> 00:02:02.194
Well, it seems I'm not the only one
who actually enjoyed that.
看来不只是我真正享受那场演出

00:02:02.278 --> 00:02:04.822
Crowds are beginning to arrive at the scene.
现场开始聚集人潮

00:02:05.573 --> 00:02:06.615
Help!
救命啊！

00:02:06.699 --> 00:02:08.284
I'm so sorry, Mr. Moon.
抱歉 穆恩先生

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:09.869
Johnny, you're on next.
强尼 下个轮到你

00:02:21.338 --> 00:02:22.673
(STRIKES PIANO KEYS)

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:27.386
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:02:37.521 --> 00:02:39.899
(SINGING POP SONG)

00:02:53.662 --> 00:02:55.080
What is that?
那是什么？

00:02:55.164 --> 00:02:56.999
Turn it down, will ya?
小声点 行吗？

00:02:58.042 --> 00:02:59.084
Oi...
嘿...

00:02:59.293 --> 00:03:01.962
Didn't you hear me? I said, turn it...
你没听见我说的？关小声点...

00:03:03.172 --> 00:03:04.215
Johnny?
强尼？

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:08.677
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:03:11.013 --> 00:03:12.264
Johnny.
强尼

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:15.893
It's Johnny!
是强尼！

00:03:16.018 --> 00:03:17.478
That's my son!
那是我儿子！

00:03:22.274 --> 00:03:23.275
My son...
我的儿子...

00:03:25.027 --> 00:03:27.071
(MUSIC CONTINUES)

00:03:33.786 --> 00:03:35.037
(GRUNTS)

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.498
-What the...
-Hey!
搞什么...

00:03:39.583 --> 00:03:40.626
Hey, hey, hey!
嘿！

00:03:49.927 --> 00:03:51.262
(CHEERING)

00:03:51.428 --> 00:03:55.307
(CONTINUES SINGING)

